meta {
  name: Update Address
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

put {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/addresses/:address_id
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  address_id: 1
}

body:json {
  {
    "label": "string",
    "recipient_name": "Example",
    "street": "string"
  }
}

docs {
**Access:** Customer (bearer)

**Request body** `AddressUpdate`:
  - `label`: string|null
  - `recipient_name`: string|null
  - `street`: string|null
  - `city`: string|null
  - `postal_code`: string|null
  - `country`: string|null
  - `state`: string|null
  - `phone`: string|null
  - `is_default_shipping`: boolean|null
  - `is_default_billing`: boolean|null

**Responses:** 200, 422
}
